+/* Served directly to preserve request URL modifiers unsupported by CSS optimizers. */
+/* Grenze 500, Google Fonts v18. These publicly distributed fonts use global
+   sharing. Hashes are SHA-256 of the exact WOFF2 responses; update each hash
+   whenever its URL changes. Keep the enhanced source before the plain fallback. */
